# JIT QA Automation

Playwright ESM (`"type": "module"`) suite for **Project Activity Reporting System**.

## Layout

- `pages/` — Page Objects by role (`superAdmin/`, `projectManager/`, `fieldResource/`) + `LoginPage.js`
- `tests/` — specs (`superAdmin/`, `e2e/`, `login.spec.js`)
- `fixtures/auth.fixture.js` — `loginAs` / `logout` (import `test`/`expect` from here when auth needed)
- `test-data/` — `users.js`, masters, e2e fixtures (no credentials in page objects)
- `utils/` — shared helpers (`e2eState`, `e2eWorkflow`, `network`, `uniqueData`)
- `docs/README.md` — QA docs index only (other docs are cursorignored)

## Roles

Super Admin, Project Manager, Field Resource. Env: `SUPER_ADMIN_*`, `ADMIN_*`→PM, `EMPLOYEE_*`→FR.

## Docs — open only when needed (do not bulk-load)

| Need | File |
|------|------|
| Index | `docs/README.md` |
| App/domain overview | `docs/PROJECT_ANALYSIS.md` |
| Permissions by role | `docs/ROLE_MATRIX.md` |
| Business invariants | `docs/BUSINESS_RULES.md` |
| What/how to test | `docs/TEST_STRATEGY.md` |
| Known defect patterns | `docs/BUG_PATTERNS.md` |
| Manual TC packs | `docs/test-cases/*.md` (one file) |
| Framework gaps / structure | `docs/framework/*` |
| Exploratory catalog | `docs/EXPLORATORY_BUG_CATALOG.md` (large — last resort) |

## Token / context rules

- Prefer the specific page/spec/util being edited — never preload all of `docs/`.
- Open **one** doc at a time via `@` / Read when the task needs domain or TC context.
- Never commit `.env`, credentials, or `lastWorkflow.json`.
- Match existing style: `// @ts-check`, short file header comments, role-based locators.
